You with to fold their at evening
Round your neck, and tell you how the day passed
With its play and study. and to kiss you
Ere they lay small heads upon their pillows;
You with none to come and whisper shyly
Girlhoods tender. budding aspirations;
You with tall boys to walk beside you,
Arm shoulder, and with apt persuasion.
Let you share young manhoods high ambitions.
